d", "text": "Internet", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Internet", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 75054, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 31551, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "6eaab8a492be6471", "type": "ellipse", "x": 570, "y": 1873, "width": 24, "height": 24, "strokeColor": "#F59E0B", "backgroundColor": "#78350F", "fillStyle": "solid", "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 61728, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 73354, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "89a6b6a47f5297d9", "type": "text", "x": 574, "y": 1876, "width": 16, "height": 16, "strokeColor": "#FFFFFF", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "5", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "5", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 57173, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 71668, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "0a60fc86ce70acb2", "type": "text", "x": 620, "y": 1875, "width": 320, "height": 80, "strokeColor": "#94A3B8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "\u2460 EC2 needs a software update\n\u2461 Route table: 0.0.0.0/0 \u2192 NAT GW\n\u2462 NAT replaces private IP with public\n\u2463 IGW sends to internet\n\u2464 Response comes back same path", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\u2460 EC2 needs a software update\n\u2461 Route table: 0.0.0.0/0 \u2192 NAT GW\n\u2462 NAT replaces private IP with public\n\u2463 IGW sends to internet\n\u2464 Response comes back same path", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 84982, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 94959, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "9ca763912470b3fb", "type": "text", "x": -80, "y": 2005, "width": 1040, "height": 80, "strokeColor": "#94A3B8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "WHY PRIVATE SUBNETS?  Your databases and app servers don't need to be reached from the internet.\nKeeping them private = nobody can hack in directly. Only the load balancer in the public subnet is exposed.\nIf the private server needs to download updates, NAT Gateway handles it (outbound only \u2014 nobody can initiate contact IN).", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "WHY PRIVATE SUBNETS?  Your databases and app servers don't need to be reached from the internet.\nKeeping them private = nobody can hack in directly. Only the load balancer in the public subnet is exposed.\nIf the private server needs to download updates, NAT Gateway handles it (outbound only \u2014 nobody can initiate contact IN).", "lineHeight": 1.25, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 36221, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 61979, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "97ffcddf14aafd48", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2000, "y": 1465, "width": 200, "height": 70, "strokeColor": "#EC4899", "backgroundColor": "#831843", "fillStyle": "solid", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "angle": 0, "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "seed": 17929, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 31078, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "fa4487789a7d5515", "type": "text", "x": 2010, "y": 1475, "width": 180, "height": 50, "strokeColor": "#EC4899", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "text": "Subnet Design\nPatterns"